       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. FMTNAME.
      *****************************************************************
      * CALLED SUBPROGRAM - SQUEEZES A CUSTOMER NAME INTO AN ADDRESS   *
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-WORK-NAME             PIC X(30).
       01  WS-NAME-LEN              PIC S9(4)       COMP.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-CUST-NAME             PIC X(30).
       01  LK-FULL-ADDRESS          PIC X(70).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-CUST-NAME LK-FULL-ADDRESS.
       0000-MAIN.
           MOVE LK-CUST-NAME TO WS-WORK-NAME
           INSPECT WS-WORK-NAME TALLYING WS-NAME-LEN FOR ALL ' '
           IF WS-WORK-NAME = 'UNKNOWN'
               MOVE SPACES TO LK-FULL-ADDRESS
           END-IF
           STRING WS-WORK-NAME DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  INTO LK-FULL-ADDRESS
           END-STRING
           GOBACK.
